{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00795","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周郊祀乐章 昭顺乐 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周郊祀乐章 昭顺乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云门孤竹，苍璧黄琮。\n既祀天地，克配祖宗。\n虔修盛礼，仰荅玄功。\n神归碧落，福降无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}